OL,3,GNEWSAProxy voting to be used for first
OL,4,Atime in Sark
OL,5,
OL,6,FSark residents have been given guidance
OL,7,Fon how proxy voting will work in the
OL,8,Fisland's next general election.
OL,10,FIn September, Chief Pleas agreed to
OL,11,Fallow voting by proxy and introduce it
OL,12,Fin time for the election on 25
OL,13,FNovember.
OL,15,FIt said people wanting to vote by proxy
OL,16,Fwere asked to complete a form and hand
OL,17,Fit in to the returning officer by 15:30
OL,18,FGMT on 17 November. To apply they
OL,19,Falready have to be registered to vote -
OL,20,Fthe electoral roll closed to new
OL,21,Fentries last week.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
