OL,3,GNEWSAProxy voting to be used for first
OL,4,Atime in Sark
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will be the first time voters who
OL,7,Fwill be away from Sark or otherwise
OL,8,Funable to attend a polling station on
OL,9,Fvoting day can apply to vote by proxy.
